::JOUR_U03_L07_GP_Q01::[MLA.JOUR.COM.01] Source: The student newsroom will give a one-minute morning announcement about the school library staying open until 5:00 p.m. on Tuesdays and Thursdays during a four-week pilot program. The librarian says the schedule gives students a quiet place to finish homework after clubs and tutoring. Students must sign in at the front desk, and activity buses leave at 5:10 p.m. The principal says sign-in numbers will be reviewed before the school decides whether to continue the schedule. Question 1: Which opening best fits an oral briefing? {
